    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641800/extras/c1c12cfd8d1b7e52b6c1c93d5214d167.avif?t=1750403863\" width=587 height=99 /></span><br><br><i>Never ignore the past, for it will always come back and bite.</i><br><br>Three months have passed since Dawn's transformation. Her time in Providence remains peaceful, but Mar, the demon king and Lucia's father, is approaching.<br>His presence will change everything, and not everyone will leave Providence unscathed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641800/extras/4babd95749c5238b26ad934023bdfa88.avif?t=1750403863\" width=587 height=99 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641800/extras/9d04e7defaeaa69875c7e19de72854f8.avif?t=1750403863\" width=587 height=155 /></span><br>Dawn is now a zombie! While her journey to transition is over, her journey is not. She still has much to learn and accept from herself. Including a mysterious ghost friend which Dawn doesn't know whether they're friendly or quite hostile...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641800/extras/38a28d5f09c8c544815466b033be7bcd.avif?t=1750403863\" width=587 height=155 /></span><br>After using magic to bring her friend back, Lucia now has to pay the price. She became a talented alchemist, but can she find a cure before her father takes care of the problem his own way?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641800/extras/827322dd20eecc375efe73841b2a94db.avif?t=1750403863\" width=587 height=155 /></span><br>Long before Providence, Vulcan had found home in the demon realm. She became part of a family that will soon reunite, yet never seemed so far apart. She must now answer to the choices she made so long ago.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641800/extras/1292ea74f794f994646de76d5e170fa1.avif?t=1750403863\" width=587 height=99 /></span><br>-About 40k words (3-4 hours of playtime)<br>-A linear story that explore Vulcan's past in the demon realm.<br>-Animated background and visual effects that give life to the environment!<br>-An entirely original soundtrack, now even richer!",
